<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nb">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Erlend Foss Møller — CV</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Bachelorstudent i kunstig intelligens ved Universitetet i Innlandet. Erfaring fra Forsvaret, kafédrift og utvikling." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' fill='%231a1a1a'/%3E%3Ctext x='16' y='23' font-family='Georgia, serif' font-size='20' font-weight='400' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23fafaf7' font-style='italic'%3EE%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fafaf7;
      --ink: #1a1a1a;
      --ink-soft: #4a4a4a;
      --ink-muted: #8a8a85;
      --rule: #e5e3dc;
      --accent: #c8553d;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --display: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      --body: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--body);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-weight: 400;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out;
    }

    .header-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 180px;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .header-text {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .portrait {
      width: 180px;
      height: 225px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 2px;
      filter: grayscale(15%) contrast(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--rule);
      transition: filter 0.4s ease;
    }

    .portrait:hover {
      filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1.02);
    }

    .meta-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .lang-switcher {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .lang-btn {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.1rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .lang-btn:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    .lang-btn.active {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .lang-divider {
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .meta-top .dot {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-right: 0.6rem;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
    }

    h1 .accent {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 540px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .header-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    .header-links a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .header-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .header-links .location {
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      border: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section {
      padding: 4.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    section:last-of-type {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .section-label::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--rule);
    }

    /* About */
    .about-text {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--ink);
      max-width: 640px;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    }

    .about-text em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Experience / Education entries */
    .entry {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    }

    .entry:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .entry-date {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-feature-settings: 'tnum';
      padding-top: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .entry-body h3 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .entry-org {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    }

    .entry-place {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .entry-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    /* PDF download button */
    .pdf-section {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .pdf-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.7rem;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
      font-weight: 500;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .pdf-button:hover {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .pdf-button svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    /* Project toggle button */
    .projects-toggle {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .projects-toggle:hover {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--bg);
    }

    .projects-toggle .arrow {
      display: inline-block;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    .projects-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] .arrow {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }

    .projects-toggle .count {
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    .projects-toggle:hover .count {
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .projects-content {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: max-height 0.5s ease, opacity 0.4s ease, margin-top 0.3s ease;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .projects-content.open {
      max-height: 3000px;
      opacity: 1;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* Project cards */
    .project {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    }

    .project:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .project-meta {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      padding-top: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .project-meta .project-type {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }

    .project-body h3 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .project-body h3 a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .project-body h3 a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .project-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    .project-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .stack-tag {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
      padding: 0.22rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .project-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .project-links a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .project-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Skills */
    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .skills-category {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      padding-top: 0.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .skills-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .skills-list li {
      position: relative;
    }

    .skills-list li:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: '·';
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-left: 1.25rem;
      position: absolute;
      right: -1rem;
    }

    /* Contact */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .contact-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      padding-top: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .contact-value a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .contact-value a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .contact-value {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-value:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    /* Animations */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    section {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease-out forwards;
    }

    section:nth-of-type(1) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    section:nth-of-type(2) { animation-delay: 0.22s; }
    section:nth-of-type(3) { animation-delay: 0.30s; }
    section:nth-of-type(4) { animation-delay: 0.38s; }
    section:nth-of-type(5) { animation-delay: 0.46s; }
    section:nth-of-type(6) { animation-delay: 0.54s; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      header { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; }
      section { padding: 3rem 0; }
      .meta-top { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

      .header-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .portrait {
        width: 140px;
        height: 175px;
        order: -1;
      }

      .entry,
      .project,
      .skills-grid,
      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .entry-date,
      .project-meta,
      .skills-category,
      .contact-label {
        padding-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      }

      .about-text { font-size: 1.2rem; }

      footer {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        background: white;
        color: black;
        font-size: 10.5pt;
      }
      .container { max-width: 100%; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
      header, section { animation: none; opacity: 1; }
      header { padding: 1rem 0 1.25rem; }
      section { padding: 1.25rem 0; page-break-inside: avoid; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.2rem !important; }
      .tagline { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      .header-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 130px; gap: 1.5rem; }
      .portrait { width: 130px; height: 165px; filter: grayscale(20%); }
      .meta-top, footer, .header-links, .projects-toggle, .pdf-section { display: none; }
      .projects-content { max-height: none !important; opacity: 1 !important; overflow: visible !important; margin-top: 1rem !important; }
      .about-text { font-size: 1rem; }
      .entry, .project { margin-bottom: 1rem; page-break-inside: avoid; }
      .section-label { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      a { color: black !important; text-decoration: none; }
      .stack-tag { background: #f0f0f0 !important; color: #333 !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <header>
      <div class="meta-top">
        <div class="lang-switcher">
          <button class="lang-btn active" data-lang="no" aria-label="Norsk">NO</button>
          <span class="lang-divider">/</span>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en" aria-label="English">EN</button>
        </div>
        <span>CV · 2026</span>
      </div>
      <div class="header-grid">
        <div class="header-text">
          <h1>Erlend Foss Møller</h1>
          <p class="tagline" data-i18n="tagline">Bachelorstudent i kunstig intelligens ved Universitetet i Innlandet. Interessert i praktisk anvendelse av KI og utvikling.</p>
          <nav class="header-links">
            <a href="#prosjekter" data-i18n="nav.projects">Prosjekter</a>
            <a href="#erfaring" data-i18n="nav.experience">Erfaring</a>
            <a href="#utdanning" data-i18n="nav.education">Utdanning</a>
            <a href="#kontakt" data-i18n="nav.contact">Kontakt</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <img src="erlend.jpg" alt="Portrett av Erlend Foss Møller" class="portrait" />
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="pdf-section">
      <button class="pdf-button" id="pdfButton" onclick="window.print()" aria-label="Last ned CV som PDF">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
          <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
          <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
        </svg>
        <span data-i18n="pdf.button">Last ned CV som PDF</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <section id="om">
      <div class="section-label" data-i18n="section.about">Om</div>
      <p class="about-text" data-i18n="about.text">
        Jeg er en student med bred arbeidserfaring fra Forsvaret, kafédrift og frivillighet — kombinert med en faglig interesse for kunstig intelligens og programvareutvikling.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="prosjekter">
      <div class="section-label" data-i18n="section.projects">Prosjekter</div>

      <button class="projects-toggle" id="projectsToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="projectsContent">
        <span class="toggle-text" data-i18n="projects.show">Vis prosjekter</span>
        <span class="count">(2)</span>
        <span class="arrow">▾</span>
      </button>

      <div class="projects-content" id="projectsContent">
        <div class="project">
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="project-type" data-i18n="project.group">Gruppeoppgave</span>
            2025
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/erlend-fm/TeamSync" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TeamSync</a></h3>
            <p class="project-desc" data-i18n="project.teamsync.desc">Fullstack-webapplikasjon utviklet som gruppeoppgave ved Universitetet i Innlandet. Bygd med Next.js og TypeScript på frontend, og Supabase (PostgreSQL) som backend og database.</p>
            <div class="project-stack">
              <span class="stack-tag">Next.js</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Supabase</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Tailwind CSS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="https://github.com/erlend-fm/TeamSync" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="project">
          <div class="project-meta">
            <span class="project-type" data-i18n="project.student">Studentprosjekt</span>
            2025
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3><a href="https://website-campus-connect.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CampusConnect</a></h3>
            <p class="project-desc" data-i18n="project.campus.desc">Chrome Extension for studenter ved Universitetet i Innlandet — samler informasjon og ressurser ett sted. Tagline: "One place. Every answer." Tilhørende prosjektnettside som presenterer teamet og fremtidige planer, hostet på Vercel.</p>
            <div class="project-stack">
              <span class="stack-tag">HTML</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">CSS</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Chrome Extension</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href="https://website-campus-connect.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="project.demo">Live demo →</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/erlend-fm/Website-CampusConnect" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="erfaring">
      <div class="section-label" data-i18n="section.experience">Erfaring</div>

      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-date" data-i18n="exp.alby.date">2021 — Nåtid</div>
        <div class="entry-body">
          <h3 data-i18n="exp.alby.title">Skiftleder og barista</h3>
          <div class="entry-org" data-i18n="exp.alby.org">Alby Cafe — Deltid</div>
          <div class="entry-place">Jeløy, Moss</div>
          <p class="entry-desc" data-i18n="exp.alby.desc">Startet som medarbeider i 2021 og ble forfremmet til skiftleder i 2023. Ansvar for kvalitet og logistikk under skiftet — kundeservice, matproduksjon, renhold og forberedelser i et travelt kafémiljø. Kaffekurs gjennom Rebel Coffee Academy (tidl. Oslo Barista School) og erfaring med La Marzocco espressomaskiner. Bidrar også med baking, inkludert hvetebakst, rugbrød og Alby-kringle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-date">2024 — 2025</div>
        <div class="entry-body">
          <h3 data-i18n="exp.mil.title">Førstegangstjeneste</h3>
          <div class="entry-org">Forsvaret — Norwegian Armed Forces</div>
          <div class="entry-place">Stavanger</div>
          <p class="entry-desc" data-i18n="exp.mil.desc">Fullført førstegangstjeneste med tilknytning til vaktlag. Sanitetsansvarlig og skytter på eget vaktlag, samt verv som tillitsvalgt. Turnusordning med dag- og nattevakter, inkludert lengre perioder med nattarbeid og 12-timersvakter. Vant til ansvar, strukturert arbeid og samarbeid i krevende situasjoner.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-date">2021 — 2025</div>
        <div class="entry-body">
          <h3 data-i18n="exp.vinter.title">Kassemedarbeider, Vinterlarm Skimesse</h3>
